    a list called 'the lines' is ['the declaration', 'the length check', 'the size check', 'the empty check', 'the stale declaration', 'the stale handler', 'the first flag declaration', 'the first line', 'the first handler', 'the first error check', 'the first value check', 'the last flag declaration', 'the last line', 'the last handler', 'the last error check', 'the last value check'].
