    a text called 'the insert value check' is 'gen assert number is' of "LST-43" and 'the insert holder' and 'the inserted value'.
    a text called 'the insert length check' is 'gen assert number is' of "LST-43" and 'the length access' and 2.
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the declaration', 'the replace line', 'the replace capture', 'the replace value check', 'the replace length check', 'the insert line', 'the insert capture', 'the insert value check', 'the insert length check'].
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the lines'.

