    a text called 'the capture line' is "If {'the subject'} is {'the predicate'} then, Set {'the holder'} to true. Print {'the holder'}".
    a text called 'the check' is "".
    If 'the expected' then,
        Set 'the check' to 'gen assert true' of 'the row' and 'the holder'.
    If 'the expected' is false then,
        Set 'the check' to 'gen assert false' of 'the row' and 'the holder'.
    a list called 'the trio' is ['the reset line', 'the capture line', 'the check'].
    Return a list, 'the trio'.

(A random ORDERING of a fixed set of tags - "vary everything no rule
