 tame `'rng below' of 1000` - fixed here to 'gen extreme number', so a
 nested value can land on 0, i64::MIN/MAX-adjacent, or any drawn-length
 magnitude in between. Only equality is asserted (never arithmetic), and
 list/map storage was hand-verified to round-trip i64::MAX and an
 18-digit value exactly on both compilers before this leaf was widened
 to draw them.)

