            Set 'the element' to 'gen value payload' of 6.
        If 'slots built' is 0 then,
            Set 'the slots' to 'the element'.
        If 'slots built' is greater than 0 then,
            Set 'the slots' to "{'the slots'}, {'the element'}".
        Set 'slots built' to 'slots built' add 1.
