    a text called 'what the empty slot reported' is 'gen type phrase' of 'the empty slot possessive'.
    'gen emit' of "{indent}a value called {'the empty slot name'} is element {'the absent slot'} of {'the list name'}.\n".
    a text called 'the slot assertion' is "{indent}If {'the empty slot name'} is not nothing then, Print \"ASSERT VAL-21: expected nothing in slot {'the absent slot'} got {'what the empty slot reported'}\", Exit 95.\n".
