    a text called 'what the absent one reported' is 'gen type phrase' of 'the absent possessive'.
    a text called 'the absent spelling' is 'gen value payload' of 6.
    a number called 'the present tag' is 'rng below' of 6.
    a text called 'the present payload' is 'gen value payload' of 'the present tag'.
    a text called 'the present literal' is 'gen value expression' of 'the present tag' and 'the present payload'.
    a text called 'the present phrase' is 'gen fresh noun'.
